            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 144892,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uma das partes mais importantes de um HUD de jogo é o texto. Podemos modificar o texto de várias maneiras, desde o tamanho até o estilo ou espessura.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p style=&quot;font-family: Courier New;&quot;&gt;Score: 1200&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;Quest: Find the key&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;BOSS INCOMING&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p style=&quot;font-style: italic;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Critical Hit!&#xA;   +50&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;LEVEL UP!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Tip: Press R to reload&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
